@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

rectangle "live 런타임" as Live {
  rectangle "기록된 tick / 스캔" as Rec
  rectangle "live 상태, journal, intent,\ntrace/outcome, frame sequence,\n시계, 마지막 outcome" as State
}
rectangle "별도의 ghost 인스턴스" as Ghost
rectangle "replay 결과\n(runtime.replay)" as Result
actor "호출자" as Caller

Caller --> Ghost : replayTemporal({count, profile,\nmaxPeakTemporalBytes, maxJsonBytes})
Rec --> Ghost : 가장 오래된 적격 prefix 직전의\ncheckpoint + record
Ghost --> Result : 성공 시 이것만 교체
Ghost ..> State : effect 없음,\n변경 없음
@enduml
